Id: apa014w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_apache
Fix: Load mod_reqtimeout and set RequestReadTimeout.
References: Apache Module mod_reqtimeout; Apache Module mod_qos
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6, CM-7; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

Neither mod_reqtimeout nor mod_qos is loaded: a client that sends
its headers one byte at a time holds a worker forever (Slowloris).
Load mod_reqtimeout, which ships with Apache, and set
RequestReadTimeout. Withheld where the configuration loads no
modules by name: a statically built server may carry one inside.
